================================================================================
2. notebooks/dsp_lnn.ipynb - Lagrangian Neural Networks
================================================================================

Source:  https://github.com/MilesCranmer/lagrangian_nns
License: Apache License 2.0 - full text in LICENSES/Apache-2.0-lagrangian_nns.txt
Paper:   Cranmer, M., Greydanus, S., Hoyer, S., Battaglia, P., Spergel, D., &
         Ho, S. (2020). Lagrangian Neural Networks. ICLR 2020 Workshop
         DeepDiffEq. https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.04630

Changes: Required notice of modification under Apache License 2.0, section 4(b).
         The upstream planar double-pendulum example was adapted to the double
         spherical pendulum. The state was extended from two generalized
         coordinates to four (theta_1, phi_1, theta_2, phi_2), with the
         corresponding Lagrangian, analytical reference dynamics, data
         generation and animation code rewritten for the three-dimensional
         system. The network architecture, Euler-Lagrange formulation,
         optimizer and pseudoinverse-based solve for the generalized
         accelerations are unchanged from upstream.


